    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Yes Sir you command your little army of roman soldiers to their target positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up! Down! Left! Right!<br>What starts as a simple mechanic will make your brain smoke after some time.<br>Especially after the levels get larger and larger and additional block types such as different soldiers, two-direction fences, and one-direction stairs make the options to consider more and more complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your solution to the performance of other commanders out there and figure out the optimal solution for each of the more than 200 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soldiers are awaiting your orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.poster.avif?t=1743530644\" width=528 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.webm?t=1743530644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.mp4?t=1743530644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 levels in 5 levels of difficulty. Ranging from easy to expert level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadlock free puzzles.<br>Even if you make a wrong move. The levels are setup such that you can always still reach the goal. <i>All roads lead to Rome!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level stats<br>Compare your solution to the solution of other players.<br>See how many moves it took other players to solve the level. <br>Optimize your solution until you reach an optimal solution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements<br>Strive for completing in game milestones and be rewarded by a multitude of achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are your ready for your adventure? <br>Your soldiers are waiting. At your command!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Yes Sir you command your little army of roman soldiers to their target positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up! Down! Left! Right!<br>What starts as a simple mechanic will make your brain smoke after some time.<br>Especially after the levels get larger and larger and additional block types such as different soldiers, two-direction fences, and one-direction stairs make the options to consider more and more complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your solution to the performance of other commanders out there and figure out the optimal solution for each of the more than 200 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soldiers are awaiting your orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.poster.avif?t=1743530644\" width=528 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.webm?t=1743530644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.mp4?t=1743530644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 levels in 5 levels of difficulty. Ranging from easy to expert level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadlock free puzzles.<br>Even if you make a wrong move. The levels are setup such that you can always still reach the goal. <i>All roads lead to Rome!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level stats<br>Compare your solution to the solution of other players.<br>See how many moves it took other players to solve the level. <br>Optimize your solution until you reach an optimal solution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements<br>Strive for completing in game milestones and be rewarded by a multitude of achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are your ready for your adventure? <br>Your soldiers are waiting. At your command!</p>",
    "short_description": "Yes Sir! Your soldiers are awaiting your orders. Will you be able to lead them to success? They are at your command in this cozy but challenging sokoban puzzle game.",
